{
  "name": "AI Ops — Server Health Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🖥️ Server Health Monitor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nRuns every 5 minutes. Checks a list of servers/endpoints via HTTP ping. If any are down or slow (>2s), sends an AI-generated diagnosis to Slack.\n\n**Setup steps:**\n1. Edit the `Server List` node — add your server URLs/IPs\n2. Set your threshold in the `Check Health` node (default: 2000ms)\n3. Add Slack Webhook URL as an n8n variable or paste directly\n4. Add Claude/OpenRouter credentials (see AI Credential note)\n5. Activate the workflow — it runs every 5 minutes automatically\n\n**Tip:** You can extend this to check databases, APIs, or DNS resolution.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{"field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 5}]
        }
      },
      "id": "cron-001",
      "name": "Every 5 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [80, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "name": "servers",
              "value": "=[\n  {\"name\": \"API Gateway\", \"url\": \"https://your-api.example.com/health\"},\n  {\"name\": \"Auth Service\", \"url\": \"https://your-auth.example.com/ping\"},\n  {\"name\": \"Database Proxy\", \"url\": \"https://your-db-proxy.example.com/health\"},\n  {\"name\": \"Frontend\", \"url\": \"https://your-app.example.com\"}\n]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "name": "timeout_ms",
              "value": 2000,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-001",
      "name": "Server List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [300, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✏️ Edit Server List Here\n\nReplace the server URLs in the `Server List` node with your actual endpoints.\n\nFormat:\n```json\n[\n  {\"name\": \"My API\", \"url\": \"https://api.mysite.com/health\"},\n  {\"name\": \"Dashboard\", \"url\": \"https://app.mysite.com\"}\n]\n```\n\nThe workflow will ping each one and report response times.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-002",
      "name": "Server Config Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, -200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "servers",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "split-001",
      "name": "Split Into Individual Servers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [520, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 5000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-001",
      "name": "Ping Server",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [740, 80],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "server_name",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Into Individual Servers').item.json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "server_url",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Into Individual Servers').item.json.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "name": "status_code",
              "value": "={{ $json.statusCode || 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c4",
              "name": "response_time_ms",
              "value": "={{ $json.headers?.['x-response-time'] || 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c5",
              "name": "is_down",
              "value": "={{ $json.statusCode >= 400 || $json.statusCode === 0 || !!$json.error }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "c6",
              "name": "error_message",
              "value": "={{ $json.error?.message || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-002",
      "name": "Check Health Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [960, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict"},
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.is_down }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {"type": "boolean", "operation": "true"}
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-001",
      "name": "Is Server Down?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1180, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {"name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01"},
            {"name": "content-type", "value": "application/json"}
          ]
        },
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-opus-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 512,\n  \"messages\": [{\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": \"Server '{{ $json.server_name }}' ({{ $json.server_url }}) is DOWN.\\nStatus code: {{ $json.status_code }}\\nError: {{ $json.error_message }}\\n\\nAs a senior SRE, provide:\\n1. Most likely cause (1 sentence)\\n2. Top 3 diagnostic commands to run\\n3. Escalation recommendation (yes/no and why)\\n\\nBe concise. Plain text, no markdown.\"\n  }]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-002",
      "name": "AI Diagnosis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1400, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CLAUDE_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Claude API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $vars.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL || 'https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/WEBHOOK/URL' }}",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"🔴 *SERVER DOWN: {{ $('Check Health Status').item.json.server_name }}*\",\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"header\",\n      \"text\": {\"type\": \"plain_text\", \"text\": \"🔴 Server Down Alert\"}\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"section\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\"type\": \"mrkdwn\", \"text\": \"*Server:*\\n{{ $('Check Health Status').item.json.server_name }}\"},\n        {\"type\": \"mrkdwn\", \"text\": \"*URL:*\\n{{ $('Check Health Status').item.json.server_url }}\"},\n        {\"type\": \"mrkdwn\", \"text\": \"*Status:*\\n{{ $('Check Health Status').item.json.status_code }}\"},\n        {\"type\": \"mrkdwn\", \"text\": \"*Time:*\\n{{ $now.toISO() }}\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"section\",\n      \"text\": {\"type\": \"mrkdwn\", \"text\": \"*AI Diagnosis:*\\n{{ $json.content[0].text }}\"}\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-003",
      "name": "Alert Slack — Server Down",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1620, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "noop-001",
      "name": "Server OK — No Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1400, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 5 Minutes": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Server List", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Server List": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Split Into Individual Servers", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Split Into Individual Servers": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Ping Server", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Ping Server": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Check Health Status", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Check Health Status": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Is Server Down?", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    },
    "Is Server Down?": {
      "main": [
        [{"node": "AI Diagnosis", "type": "main", "index": 0}],
        [{"node": "Server OK — No Action", "type": "main", "index": 0}]
      ]
    },
    "AI Diagnosis": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Alert Slack — Server Down", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {"executionOrder": "v1"},
  "meta": {"templateCredsSetupCompleted": false, "instanceId": "flowmindlabs"},
  "tags": [{"name": "ai-ops"}, {"name": "monitoring"}, {"name": "flowmindlabs"}]
}
